save__pdbx_deposition_rule.join_flag
    _item_description.description
;    Flag indicating that rows of the rule's scope category are paired
     with rows of its partner categories as defined in
     PDBX_DEPOSITION_RULE_JOIN. If NO, every scope row is paired with
     every row of each partner category.
;
